    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Your vehicle data stays on your device.\n\nRovena works completely offline. There is no account, no login, and no cloud database. Every vehicle, maintenance record, fuel entry, expense, document, inspection and reminder you add is stored only in this app\'s local database on this device.\n\nRovena does not include analytics, tracking, or remote logging of any kind, and never transmits your vehicle information anywhere. The only way your data leaves this device is if you explicitly create a backup file and share or move it yourself.</string>
    <string name="terms_title">Terms</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Rovena is provided as-is, for personal vehicle record-keeping. The Vehicle Health Score and inspection scores are informational estimates based only on the data you enter - they are not a mechanical diagnosis and should not replace a professional inspection. You are responsible for the accuracy of the data you enter and for keeping your own backups.</string>
    <string name="licenses_title">Open Source Licenses</string>
    <string name="licenses_body">Rovena is built with the following open-source software, each under the Apache License 2.0 unless noted:\n\n• AndroidX (Core, AppCompat, Lifecycle, Navigation, Room, WorkManager, DataStore, Biometric)\n• Material Components for Android\n• Kotlin &amp; Kotlin Coroutines (Apache 2.0)\n• Coil - Image loading (Apache 2.0)</string>
